{"name": "ArcaneBound", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/812f45576344ae509c8f6ebfef0094a3.poster.avif?t=1782745110\" width=\"576\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/812f45576344ae509c8f6ebfef0094a3.webm?t=1782745110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/812f45576344ae509c8f6ebfef0094a3.mp4?t=1782745110\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One wizard. Bound familiars. An apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ArcaneBound</strong> is a 2D pixel-art action RPG where you battle through <strong>hordes of monsters</strong>, collect <strong>cards</strong>, discover <strong>familiars</strong>, and build a <strong>deck</strong> capable of <strong>wiping out entire waves of enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death is not the end: time resets, but <strong>your build keeps evolving</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"762\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/19646cad6c4840e8d9fcebf802a62df0.poster.avif?t=1782745110\" width=\"758\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/19646cad6c4840e8d9fcebf802a62df0.webm?t=1782745110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/19646cad6c4840e8d9fcebf802a62df0.mp4?t=1782745110\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cards from enemies and bosses, choose your skills and familiars, experiment with devastating synergies, and push exploration further and further to uncover <strong>what is trying to kill you</strong>\u2026 and how to stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Numerous skills and familiars</strong> with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A card system</strong> with drops from enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combine cards, skills, and familiars</strong> to create devastating custom spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bond with familiars</strong> that attack automatically and grow alongside you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent upgrades</strong> to become increasingly powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly elite monsters and bosses</strong> offering rare rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"780\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/9e4c80ffc6fb996592a67ce393ddcf30.poster.avif?t=1782745110\" width=\"1002\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/9e4c80ffc6fb996592a67ce393ddcf30.webm?t=1782745110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/extras/9e4c80ffc6fb996592a67ce393ddcf30.mp4?t=1782745110\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "ArcaneBound is a pixel-art bullet heaven action RPG. Collect familiars, defeat hordes of monsters, gather rare cards, level up, and create increasingly devastating builds.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463480/7eac55fdc5993f19bff93a46b0b325014ebc1136/header.jpg?t=1782745110", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action RPG", "Creature Collector", "Bullet Heaven", "Twin Stick Shooter", "Incremental", "Deckbuilding"], "developers": "AsardialStudio", "publishers": "AsardialStudio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4463480", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/edtmUNoKoLA", "first_seen": 1780005600.0, "review_rank": 555}